{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"The act of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/turn\" title=\"turn\">turning</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/twist\" title=\"twist\">twisting</a>, or the state of being twisted; the twisting or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wrench\" title=\"wrench\">wrenching</a> of a body by the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/exertion\" title=\"exertion\">exertion</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/lateral\" title=\"lateral\">lateral</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/force\" title=\"force\">force</a> tending to turn one <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/end\" title=\"end\">end</a> or part of it about a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/longitudinal\" title=\"longitudinal\">longitudinal</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/axis\" title=\"axis\">axis</a>, while the other is <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/hold\" title=\"hold\">held</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fast\" title=\"fast\">fast</a> or turned in the opposite direction."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt18\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/finite\" title=\"finite\">finite</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/order\" title=\"order\">order</a> element of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/group\" title=\"group\">group</a> that, when <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/raise\" title=\"raise\">raised</a> to a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/positive\" title=\"positive\">positive</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/integer\" title=\"integer\">integer</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/power\" title=\"power\">power</a> results in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/identity_element\" title=\"identity element\">identity element</a> of the group."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt19\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> An element of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/homology\" title=\"homology\">homology</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cohomology\" title=\"cohomology\">cohomology</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/group\" title=\"group\">group</a> for which there exists a non-zero <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/integer\" title=\"integer\">integer</a> that, when the element is <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/multiply\" title=\"multiply\">multiplied</a> by that integer, yields <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/zero\" title=\"zero\">zero</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt20\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A type of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/holistic\" title=\"holistic\">holistic</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/complimentary\" title=\"complimentary\">complimentary</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/medicine\" title=\"medicine\">medicine</a> that involves <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/balance\" title=\"balance\">balancing</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/theoretical\" title=\"theoretical\">theoretical</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/energy\" title=\"energy\">energy</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/field\" title=\"field\">fields</a> through <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/energy\" title=\"energy\">energy</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/healing\" title=\"healing\">healing</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/meditation\" title=\"meditation\">meditation</a>, and similar practices."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt21\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> That <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/force\" title=\"force\">force</a> with which a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/thread\" title=\"thread\">thread</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wire\" title=\"wire\">wire</a>, or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rod\" title=\"rod\">rod</a> of any <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/material\" title=\"material\">material</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/return\" title=\"return\">returns</a>, or tends to return, to a state of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rest\" title=\"rest\">rest</a> after it has been <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/twist\" title=\"twist\">twisted</a>; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/torsibility\" title=\"torsibility\">torsibility</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt22\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/stop\" title=\"stop\">stopping</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/arterial\" title=\"arterial\">arterial</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/haemorrhage\" title=\"haemorrhage\">haemorrhage</a> in certain cases, by <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/twist\" title=\"twist\">twisting</a> the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cut\" title=\"cut\">cut</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/end\" title=\"end\">end</a> of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/artery\" title=\"artery\">artery</a>."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt72\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To subject to torsion."}]}],"da":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Danish","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt76\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/torsion#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">torsion</a></span>"}]}],"fi":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Finnish","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt81\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#genitive_case\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">genitive</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#singular_number\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">singular</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fi\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/torsio#Finnish\" title=\"torsio\">torsio</a></i></span></span>"}]}],"fr":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"French","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt89\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/torsion#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">torsion</a></span>; act of turning or twisting"}]}],"sv":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Swedish","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt98\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/torsion#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">torsion</a></span>"}]}]}